		<h3 class="dialog-header-title">Heiwase Since 1993</h3>
	</div>
</div><p class="dialog-lead">
Heiwase Karate Szeged has been shaping the karate community of Szeged for over three decades.
Over the past 30+ years, we have grown from a small circle of friends into one of the city's most prominent clubs.
Our journey has by no means been an unbroken string of successes; we have faced numerous challenges to reach where we stand today.
</p>
<h4 class="dialog-section-title">The Story of Heiwase</h4>
<ul class="dialog-timeline">
	<li><span class="dialog-timeline-year">1993</span> Zoltán Stempel founds Heiwase Karate in Szeged.</li>
	<li><span class="dialog-timeline-year">1996</span> Training sessions commence at the Csikós School, providing a permanent home for our club.</li>
</ul>
<figure class="dialog-photo-banner">
	<picture>
	  <source srcset="img/placeholders/regi-edzes.avif" type="image/avif">
