	</picture>
	<figcaption class="dialog-photo-caption">The early years: weekly training sessions in the gymnasium of the Csikós School</figcaption>
</figure>
<ul class="dialog-timeline">
	<li><span class="dialog-timeline-year">2000</span> Zoltán Stempel earns his 1st Dan black belt and his official national sports coaching certification.</li>
	<li><span class="dialog-timeline-year">2007</span> Zoltán Stempel successfully tests for his 2nd Dan black belt.</li>
	<li><span class="dialog-timeline-year">2012</span> The team operates with two additional black belt instructors alongside Sensei Zoltán.</li>
	<li><span class="dialog-timeline-year">2013</span> Alongside his 3rd Dan rank, Zoltán Stempel completes the IWKU International Instructor training program.</li>
</ul>
<figure class="dialog-photo-banner">
	<picture>
