	</picture>
	<figcaption class="dialog-photo-caption">Zoltán Stempel attains the rank of 3rd Dan</figcaption>
</figure>
<ul class="dialog-timeline">
	<li><span class="dialog-timeline-year">2014</span> Our training expands to a new location: alongside the Csikós School, we also establish a presence in the Móricz gymnasium.</li>
	<li><span class="dialog-timeline-year">2019</span> In recent years, the team has secured numerous medals at the MWKSZ National Championships and the Galga-SZAC Cups.</li>
	<li><span class="dialog-timeline-year">2020</span> Due to the Covid pandemic, training sessions transition to an online format.</li>
</ul>
