<ul class="dialog-timeline">
	<li><span class="dialog-timeline-year">2021</span> Zoltán Stempel earns his 4th Dan black belt.</li>
	<li><span class="dialog-timeline-year">2023</span> Zsolt Gábor Zimmermann secures a bronze medal at the WUKF Karate World Championship in Scotland.</li>
</ul>
