<ul class="dialog-timeline">
	<li><span class="dialog-timeline-year">2025</span> Heiwase welcomes a new instructor: sport karate sessions are now led by Bendegúz Tálas, a Hungarian national team athlete.</li>
	<li><span class="dialog-timeline-year">2026</span> The team relocates to its own dedicated dojo at Honvéd Square.</li>
	<li><span class="dialog-timeline-year">2026</span> In the same year, our national team squad returns home with 2 bronze medals from the WUKF World Championship in Cluj-Napoca.</li>
</ul>
